        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Roca volcánica intermedia, alcalina, perteneciente al grupo de los traquitoides, en la que el feldespato alcalino y la plagioclasa se encuentran en proporciones similares, entre el 35 y el 65% de los feldespatos"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Intermediate, alkaline volcanic rock belonging to the group of trachytoids, in which alkali feldspar and plagioclase are in similar proportions, between 35 and 65% of the feldspars"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch": [
      {
        "@id": "http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/latiticRock"
      },
