      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Ultrabasic, ultraalkaline plutonic rock of the melilitoid group, having melilite in proportions exceeding 10%, pyroxene and, frequently, olivine (olivine melilitolite) and nepheline as essential minerals"
      }
    ],
