  {
    "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/kimberlita",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2026-03-01"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Roca ultrabásica potásica rica en volátiles, con textura inequigranular y macrocristales de olivino, ilmenita rica en mg, granate, diópsido, flogopita, enstatita y cromita rica en ti, incluidos en una matriz de grano fino formada por olivino, monticellita, flogopita, perovskita, espinela y apatito. generalmente, contiene xenolitos del manto en los que se pueden encontrar diamantes. ascienden rápido a través del manto superior y la corteza y se emplazan explosivamente formando diatremas"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Potassic, volatile-rich ultrabasic rock with inequigranular texture and macrocrysts of olivine, Mg-rich ilmenite, garnet, diopside, phlogopite, enstatite and Ti-rich chromite, enclosed in a fine-grained groundmass of olivine, monticellite, phlogopite, perovskite, spinel and apatite. It generally contains mantle xenoliths in which diamonds may be found. It ascends rapidly through the upper mantle and crust and is emplaced explosively forming diatremes"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
