        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Caliza constituida mayoritariamente por restos calcáreos de conchas y esqueletos de organismos lamelibranquios, crinoides, foraminíferos, corales, etc."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Limestone consisting predominantly of calcareous shell and skeletal remains of organisms (lamellibranchs, crinoids, foraminifera, corals, etc.)"
      }
