        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Roca plutónica de la familia de los granitoides, en la que la plagioclasa constituye más del 90% de los feldespatos. además de biotita, puede contener hornblenda, titanita y/o piroxeno como minerales varietales"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Plutonic rock of the granitoid family, in which plagioclase constitutes more than 90% of the feldspars. In addition to biotite, it may contain hornblende, titanite and/or pyroxene as varietal minerals"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch": [
      {
        "@id": "http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/tonalite"
      },
      {
