      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Variedad del sílex, de color gris a negro debido a la presencia de materia grafitosa y carbonosa, formada esencialmente por cuarzo criptocristalino y algo de ópalo, a veces con algunos radiolarios, tiene fractura finamente astillosa"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Variety of chert, grey to black in colour due to the presence of graphitic and carbonaceous matter, formed essentially of cryptocrystalline quartz and some opal, sometimes with some radiolarians; it has a finely splintery fracture"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
