        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Gabroide mesocrato en el que la plagioclasa, predominantemente cálcica, constituye entre el 65 y el 90% de los feldespatos"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Mesocratic gabbroid in which plagioclase, predominantly calcic, constitutes between 65 and 90% of the feldspars"
      }
    ],
