        "@value": "Arenisca en la que predominan los granos de diámetro comprendido entre 0.125 y 0.25 mm"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Sandstone in which grains with a diameter between 0.125 and 0.25 mm predominate"
      }
    ],
