        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Roca plutónica leucocrática en la que la plagioclasa constituye más del 90% de la roca, siendo el piroxeno su mineral máfico más frecuente"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Leucocratic plutonic rock in which plagioclase constitutes more than 90% of the rock, with pyroxene being its most common mafic mineral"
      }
    ],
