        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Roca basáltica retrogradada, generalmente vesicular, en la que el feldespato ha sido albitizado y aparece acompañado de clorita, epidota, prehnita y otros minerales de baja temperatura hidratados"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Retrograded, generally vesicular basaltic rock in which the feldspar has been albitized and is accompanied by chlorite, epidote, prehnite and other low-temperature hydrated minerals"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch": [
