        "@value": "2026-03-01"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Precipitado químico, generalmente de carbonato o sulfato cálcicos, formado por la acción del agua en una cueva. los más conocidos son las estalactitas y las estalagmitas"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Chemical precipitate, generally of calcium carbonate or sulfate, formed by the action of water in a cave. The most well-known are stalactites and stalagmites"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
