        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Monzosienita foídica en la que la nefelina constituye el feldespatoide dominante"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Foid monzosyenite in which nepheline constitutes the dominant feldspathoid"
      }
