      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Colección de materiales que pertenecen a la categoría de Rocas Plutónicas, que se caracteriza por incluir rocas ígneas solidificadas en el interior de la corteza terrestre, a partir de un magma silicatado, generalmente de grano medio-grueso, aunque pueden tener facies de grano fino relacionadas."
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Collection of materials belonging to the category of Plutonic Rocks, characterized by including igneous rocks solidified in the interior of the Earth's crust from a silicate magma, generally medium- to coarse-grained, although they may have related fine-grained facies."
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
