        "@value": "Válido"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/andesita",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2026-03-01"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Roca volcánica intermedia, calcoalcalina, de color gris claro y generalmente porfídica, formada por plagioclasa acompañada por uno o más minerales ferromagnesianos hornblenda, biotita, ortopiroxeno o clinopiroxeno. se distingue del basalto por la composición de la plagioclasa andesina o menos cálcica, la frecuente presencia de anfíbol y su composición básica-intermedia. su equivalente plutónico es la diorita-cuarzodiorita-cuarzomonzodiorita"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Intermediate, calc-alkaline volcanic rock, light grey and generally porphyritic, formed by plagioclase accompanied by one or more ferromagnesian minerals (hornblende, biotite, orthopyroxene or clinopyroxene). It is distinguished from basalt by the composition of plagioclase (andesine or less calcic), the frequent presence of amphibole and its basic-intermediate composition. Its plutonic equivalent is diorite-quartz diorite-quartz monzodiorite"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#exactMatch": [
      {
        "@id": "http://inspire.ec.europa.eu/codelist/LithologyValue/andesite"
      },
      {
        "@id": "http://resource.geosciml.org/classifier/cgi/lithology/andesite"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "andesita"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "andesite"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#topConceptOf": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/ns/adms#status": [
      {
        "@value": "Válido"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme/caliza-aloquimica",
    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
