    "@type": [
      "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept"
    ],
    "http://purl.org/dc/terms/created": [
      {
        "@type": "http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date",
        "@value": "2026-03-01"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#isDefinedBy": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Roca formada por el mineral del mismo nombre, de fórmula k2mgca2so44.2h2o, perteneciente a la clase de los sulfatos, que cristaliza en el sistema triclínico y se presenta en masas lamelares compactas. posee color rosa o rojo"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Rock formed by the mineral of the same name, with the formula K2MgCa2(SO4)4·2H2O, belonging to the class of sulfates, crystallizing in the triclinic system and occurring as compact lamellar masses. It has a pink or red colour"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
