        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition": [
      {
        "@language": "es",
        "@value": "Asfaltita extraordinariamente pura, negra, brillante y de fractura concoidea. tiene una dureza de 2 a 2,5 y un peso específico de 1,07. contiene del 10 al 20% de carbono y arde fácilmente con llama luminosa"
      },
      {
        "@language": "en",
        "@value": "Extraordinarily pure asphaltite, black, shiny and with conchoidal fracture. It has a hardness of 2 to 2.5 and a specific gravity of 1.07. It contains 10 to 20% carbon and burns readily with a luminous flame"
      }
    ],
    "http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme": [
      {
        "@id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/material-igme"
      }
